/* One __DECL_SIMD_<scalar> block per function promised by the installed
   library.  Each block picks the notinbranch, inbranch, or both form from the
   generated per-function ABI mask, so an old compiler without the mask
   handshake, a partial library, or a --disable-mathvec build can never
   advertise an entry point that the installed libmvec does not export.
   Included by <bits/math-vector.h> after the ABI mask macros and attributes
   are defined; a translation unit must never include it directly.  */
